{"Date": "01/21/2022", "Record Number": "ZCHO2022-0009", "Record Type": "Zoning Certificate Low Impact Home Occupation", "Description": "The new business is an Online Yoga Studio. All I will be doing is adding to my website yogafortimesofchange.com the ability for people to pay for and register for online yoga classes and workshops (taught over Zoom). I work from my home (1324 Peralta Avenue, Berkeley CA 94702). There will be no physical products, no additional people coming to the house (all lessons will be via video, some conducted in different parts of the US and not by me), no additional parking needed, no deliveries of anything, and nothing at all I can think of that will affect people in the neighborhood. I already work at home as a freelance writer and have everything I need installed already (basically internet and computer).", "Project Name": "Yoga for Healthy Aging Online Yoga Studio", "Status": "Withdrawn", "Action": "Pay Fees Due", "Expiration Date": "", "Short Notes": "", "_cells": ["", "01/21/2022", "ZCHO2022-0009", "Zoning Certificate Low Impact Home Occupation", "The new business is an Online Yoga Studio. All I will be doing is adding to my website yogafortimesofchange.com the ability for people to pay for and register for online yoga classes and workshops (taught over Zoom). I work from my home (1324 Peralta Avenue, Berkeley CA 94702). There will be no physical products, no additional people coming to the house (all lessons will be via video, some conducted in different parts of the US and not by me), no additional parking needed, no deliveries of anything, and nothing at all I can think of that will affect people in the neighborhood. I already work at home as a freelance writer and have everything I need installed already (basically internet and computer).", "Yoga for Healthy Aging Online Yoga Studio", "Withdrawn", "Pay Fees Due", "", "", "1324 PERALTA Ave, BERKELEY CA 94702"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Planning&TabName=Planning&capID1=22PLN&capID2=00000&capID3=00055&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
